-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",119,{
[3777]="70028CA7\n1\tDefeat Dunlendings at Cuvnerth (total: 10)\tCuvnerth lies to the south-east of Garrun's camp. Garrun has asked you to enter Cuvnerth and drive the Dunlendings from the village.\n2\tTalk to Garrun in the Isendale\tGarrun is at his camp, north-west of Cuvnerth. You should bring word to Garrun that the Dunlendings have been driven out of the village.\n",
[3778]="7001D0CE\n1\tDefeat Folkár\030Defeat Durflágit\030Defeat Trínash\tFolkár, Durflágit, and Trínash may be found somewhere in Gathbúrz. Rodelleth has asked you and your allies to defeat three deadly Olog-hai champions.\n2\tSpeak with Rodelleth in Thangúlhad\tRodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz. You should return to Rodelleth with news of your victory.\n",
[3779]="7001A49C\n1\tDefeat Talûntûm at Burgûl-stazg\tTalûntûm may be found within the bulwark at the rear of Burgûl-stazg, north-west from Echad Mothelen. Dagorchiel has asked you to defeat Talûntûm, the captain of Burgûl-stazg.\n2\tTalk to Dagorchiel at Echad Mothelen\tDagorchiel is at Echad Mothelen, south-east from Burgûl-stazg. You should return to Dagorchiel with tidings of your victory.\n",
[3780]="70019ECC\n1\tTalk to Taskmaster Sharkûlob at Gramsfoot\tTaskmaster Sharkûlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. The trolls from Angmar, in an effort to speed the victory of Angmar's army, are willing to return Angmar to fight the Free Peoples in exchange for your services in the North. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.\n2\tTalk to Taskmaster Sharkûlob at Gramsfoot\tTaskmaster Sharkûlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. You took the place of a troll while it wrought destruction against the forces of the Free Peoples in Angmar. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.\n",
[3781]="70019EBC\n1\tTalk to Taskmaster Sharkûlob at Gramsfoot\tTaskmaster Sharkûlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. The trolls from Angmar, in an effort to speed the victory of Angmar's army, are willing to go to Eregion to fight the Free Peoples in exchange for your services in the North. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.\n2\tTalk to Taskmaster Sharkûlob at Gramsfoot\tTaskmaster Sharkûlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. You took the place of a troll in Angmar while it wrought destruction against the forces of the Free Peoples in Eregion. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.\n",
[3782]="70019EC4\n1\tTalk to Taskmaster Sharkûlob at Gramsfoot\tTaskmaster Sharkûlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. The trolls from Angmar, in an effort to speed the victory of Angmar's army, are willing to go to Forochel to fight the Free Peoples in exchange for your services in the North. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.\n2\tTalk to Taskmaster Sharkûlob at Gramsfoot\tTaskmaster Sharkûlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. You took the place of a troll in Angmar while it wrought destruction against the forces of the Free Peoples in Forochel. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.\n",
[3783]="70043DFA\n1\tKill enemy guards at The Palace of Eldacar (total: 10)\tThe Palace of Eldacar is located on the Western side of Osgiliath. You should kill enemy guards at The Palace of Eldacar.\n2\tListen to Grazadhal yell at you\tGrazadhal is at Dâr Dugoth. You should listen to Grazadhal yell at you.\n",
[3784]="7005AAF1\n1\tDestroy glowing crystals to release fell spirits\030Defeat released fell spirits (total: 4)\tGlowing crystals can be found in Mullach Cagar. You should destroy these crystals and defeat the released fell spirits.\n2\tTalk to Molkha in the valley\tYou have defeated many fell spirits in Mullach Cagar, preventing them from being used to make wights. You should report to Molkha in the valley.\n",
[3785]="7005A951\n1\tCollect crystals (total: 8)\030Collect metal ingots (total: 8)\tCrystals and metal ingots can be found near the forge in Vérnozal. You should collect crystals and metal ingots to make crystal torches.\n2\tForge crystal torches (quantity: see journal)\tA forge can be found in Vérnozal. You should forge crystal torches for dwarf explorers at the forge.\n3\tDwarf explorers can be found in Vérnozal. You should give the crystal torches you forged to the dwarf explorers.\t\n4\tTalk to Rúzat\tRúzat can be found at Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rúzat.\n",
[3786]="7005B446\n1\tDefeat crystal-encrusted Wargs (total: 6)\030Collect corrupted crystals (total: 3)\tCrystal-encrusted Wargs can be found in south-western Clovengap. Mother Amma has asked for you to defeat crystal-encrusted Wargs and to bring her crystal samples.\n2\tReturn to Mother Amma\tMother Amma is in Stókkset, in Clovengap. You should bring the crystal sarrowstone sample to Mother Amma.\n",
[3787]="700669D0\n1\tHunt dun cows for meat (total: 4)\tYou have been tasked to hunt dun cows for food. Oxen can be found on a hill called Glaerendalf, to the west.\n2\tBring the meat to Branach at the farm of Cornworth\tLocrin's brother Branach will be pleased to receive the meat you collected. He waits for you at the farm of Cornworth.\n",
[3788]="70047CEF\n1\tDefeat blighted Wastes-bears (total: 2)\030Defeat scrounging Noman-boars (total: 5)\030Defeat Noman Waste-claws (total: 3)\030Defeat scavenging crebain (total: 5)\030Defeat scrubland-crawlers (total: 3)\030Defeat mangy Waste-wolves (total: 2)\tBlighted wildlife can be found in many areas in the Noman-lands. You should destroy blighted wildlife you find while scouting in the Noman-lands.\n2\tReturn to Legolas\tLegolas can be found in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien. You should return to Legolas and tell how you have cleansed the Noman-lands of many blighted creatures.\n",
[3789]="7006A9D3\n1\tDefeat Ilmabiri crocodiles (total: 6)\tReducing the number of crocodiles in Ilmabiri should help prevent more incidents of them causing havoc in the Sail-haven.\n2\tTalk to Ahûd\tYou have reduced the number of crocodiles in the sewers. You should tell Ahûd at the guard post in the northern part of the Ilmabiri.\n",
[3790]="70022B02\n1\tDefeat grim Ashenwight-captains (total: 3)\tTrac-plas lies south and west of Mincham's camp. There are older, more powerful wights haunting the barrows of Trac-plas among their younger brethren. Mincham has asked you to seek out these creatures and defeat them.\n2\tTalk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs\tMincham's is located north and west of Trac-plas. You should return to Mincham and let him know that you have dispatched several of the grim Ashenwight-captains.\n",
[3791]="70025B7E\n1\tDefeat salamanders on Tyl Ruinen (total: 12)\tSalamanders can be found all over Tyl Ruinen. Lúgethir asked you to defeat several salamanders around Tyl Ruinen, hoping to contain their numbers.\n2\tTalk to Lúgethir on Tyl Ruinen\tLúgethir is at Humphrey Rumming's camp on Tyl Ruinen. Lúgethir will be pleased to hear the number of salamanders has been reduced.\n",
[3792]="70067F64\n1\tDefeat kergrim on the island south-west of Bakhjâd (total: 8)\tTarshiah has asked you to help cull the population of kergrim on the coast west of Mâr Naphra.\n2\tTalk to Tarshiah\tNow that the task is complete you should report back to Tarshiah.\n",
[3793]="70057835\n1\tDefeat Anduin Hunters throughout Misthallow\tMishallow is home to a fierce breed of larger hunting cats which stalk the hill and valleys in search of prey. These vile evil creatures hunt for sport — toying cruelly with their victims — instead of merely for food.\n2\tDefeat Anduin Hunters in Misthallow (total: 10)\tFierce hunting cats, known to the locals as Anduin Hunters, stalk the hills and valleys along the Langflood. These foul creatures are renown in the area for toying cruelly with their victims before ending their lives. Defeat these creatures where you find them in the Misthallow.\n3\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[3794]="7005A790\n1\tDefeat Naurnash\030Defeat Khakrank\030Defeat Wargs in Azanulibizar (total: 8)\tWargs can be found at Gadh Ujáf and Zagâf Muzug. Valdi has asked you to defeat Wargs and their sires.\n2\tReturn to Valdi\tValdi can be found in Amdân. You should talk to Valdi.\n",
[3795]="7003E920\n1\tDefeat elk in the Bruinen Gorges (total: 6)\tThere are elk dwelling in the Bruinen Gorges in the Trollshaws. The wolves which trouble the Bruinen Gorges might be deterred if the number of the elk were thinned, leaving them with little prey.\n",
[3796]="70044266\n1\tDefeat Sûhalar Easterlings (total: 12)\tSûhalar Easterlings can be found in the northern section of Pelennor Fields. You should defeat Sûhalar Easterlings so that Ingold can keep hold of the North-gate.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Sûhalar Easterlings.\n",
[3797]="70044298\n1\tDefeat Orcs in Pelennor Fields (total: 16)\tOrcs can be found throughout Pelennor Fields. You should defeat Orcs in Pelennor Fields.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Orcs.\n",
[3798]="70044299\n1\tDefeat Trolls in Pelennor Fields (total: 8)\tTrolls can be found throughout Pelennor Fields. You should defeat Trolls in Pelennor Fields.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Trolls.\n",
[3799]="70044265\n1\tDefeat Uruk-hai (total: 10)\tUruks can be found found patrolling Pelennor Fields. You should defeat Uruks before the coming battle.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Uruks upon Pelennor Fields.\n",
[3800]="7004CE3D\n1\tCollect Celeblam (total: 10)\tCeleblam flowers can be found nearby, in Eryn Lasgalen. You should collect Celeblam.\n2\tTalk to Thorlind\tThorlind can be found north of the path in Eryn Lasgalen. You should talk to Thorlind.\n",
[3801]="700597CB\n1\tMark wilderyew trees (total: 8)\030Plant seedlings (total: 10)\tPlaces to plant trees and to mark the wilderyew trees can be found in the southern Wildwood. Thornmane has asked you to mark the wilderyew trees for culling and to plant the seeds of a less aggressive tree type.\n2\tTalk to Thornmane\tThornmane is in the southern Wildwood. You should talk to Thornmane.\n",
[3802]="70065EA8\n1\tDeliver macerated earth to Faranil at Glân Vraig (total: 7)\tFaranil asked that you make your way to the north-west to seek out cave-claws that move the earth with their mandibles. She believes that you can collect earth from within their maws that will be better for your sapling.\n",
[3803]="70065EAB\n1\tSpeak with Emerald Twospade in Hoarhallow\tMake your way to Hoarhallow, talk to Emerald Twospade and ask her how she heartens the plants that she tends.\n2\tEmerald Twospade advises that you should sing to your sapling\tEmerald told you the secret is to sing to the plant. Return to Glân Vraig and sing to your sapling.\n",
[3804]="70065B0A\n1\tTravel to Ost Ringdyr and speak with Emissary Pip Diggins\tMake your way north to Ost Ringdyr and speak with Emissary Pip Diggins of Hoarhallow. He may have knowledge of the sapling that you discovered.\n2\tSpeak with Ned Claybrick\030Speak with Emerald Twospade\030Speak with Marigold Winterdown\tMake your way from Ost Ringdyr to Hoarhallow far to the south-west. There, find and speak with Marigold Winterdown, Ned Claybrick, and Emerald Twospade about the sapling.\n3\tTalk to Faranil\tAfter speaking with the residents of Hoarhallow, it is clear that they have never seen a sapling like you have found. They have seen the vile Huorns that make the woods their home near their village of Hoarhallow. Return to the cultivator and explain what you learned.\n",
[3805]="70065EA6\n1\tSpeak with Golloval in the shadow of the Isendeep Mine\tHead toward the Isendeep mine, and in the shadow of the entrance find the Eagle Golloval. Ask the eagle if he might know how to enhance the mood of the sapling kept at Glân Vraig.\n2\tDeliver the bauble to Golloval\030Collect a glass bauble from goblins, wargs, or spiders\tGolloval needs a glass bauble to capture a ray of the sun. He tasked you with trying to collect one from the goblins in Grothum, the Warg dens in the west, or the amongst the spiders in the craggy stones - far to the west.\n3\tDeliver the bauble to Faranil at Glân Vraig\tYou received the infused bauble from Golloval and were advised to return the bauble to the cultivator at Glân Vraig.\n",
[3806]="70065EAF\n1\tDeliver auorchs manure to Faranil at Glân Vraig (total: 7)\tMake your way to the plains surrounding the Hoardale and collect the manure from the piles lift behind by the Thistledown Aurochs there.\n",
[3807]="70065E9D\n1\tSpeak with Elrond at the Last Homely House\tFaranil directed you to tell the tale of how you discovered and claimed the sapling to Elrond at the Last Homely House in Rivendell. She hopes that the Lord of Rivendell may know something of the sapling you found.\n2\tReturn to Faranil at Glân Vraig with your news\tElrond could no more explain your discovery of the sapling than could Faranil. He insisted that you continue your efforts. He believes that you may be working toward healing the Ettenmoors in some fashion.\n",
[3808]="70065EAD\n1\tSpeak with Radagast at Ost Guruth\tFaranil, seeking more information on the sapling that you are raising, directed you to Ost Guruth, an outpost in the Lone-lands, where Radagast the Brown has been seen. She bid you visit him and share your tale of discovering and nurturing the sapling.\n2\tTalk to Faranil\tRadagast suggested that you are helping to grow a noble creatures by your efforts and advised that you should continue on the path that you are set upon.\n",
})
